{"parentUuid":"e294cd5b-da24-4ba9-a24d-14c4c9029371","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"421ba671-1d86-45df-b987-85d30fef7791","agentId":"a9bc91478f203aae9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CMgAdyz2LMt6ugQDm5Jgdo","type":"tool_result","content":"   → hat3_v9n.glb · 9 sn\r\nZİNCİR BİTTİ · 1 adım · 9 sn\r\n\n===== ADIM 46 · . $ python \"{YAMA}/46_b_pu_levha.py\" hat3_v9m.glb hat3_v9n.glb\n  pu_sol             32317129 mm³ → 8 parça (Σ 32317129.0, fark 0.000 mm³): pu_sol 31750345, pu_sol_arka_serit 562148, pu_sol_kose_alt_1 297, pu_sol_kose_alt_2 1680, pu_sol_kose_alt_3 342, pu_sol_kose_ust_1 297, pu_sol_kose_ust_2 1680, pu_sol_kose_ust_3 342\n  pu_arka_yuksek     41837059 mm³ → 2 parça (Σ 41837059.0, fark 0.000 mm³): pu_arka_yuksek_arka 26292172, pu_arka_yuksek_on 15544887\n  pu_arka_alcak      34321109 mm³ → 2 parça (Σ 34321109.2, fark 0.000 mm³): pu_arka_alcak_arka 21605036, pu_arka_alcak_on 12716073\n  tk_depo_arka_pu     3344404 mm³ → 2 parça (Σ 3344403.8, fark 0.000 mm³): tk_depo_arka_pu 3344324, tk_depo_arka_pu_kose 79\n  tk_depo_sag_pu      8959610 mm³ → 2 parça (Σ 8959609.8, fark 0.000 mm³): tk_depo_sag_pu 8958228, tk_depo_sag_pu_kose 1382\nsıkıştırıldı hat3_v9n.glb: 279.4 → 265.2 MB · accessor 5637 · bufferView 5639\nADIM 46 bitti · 5 blok → 16 parça · hat3_v9n.glb · 7 sn","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"53a402a4-cdfe-4a33-a4ec-41a2980129c6","timestamp":"2026-10-04T12:24:12.509Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e294cd5b-da24-4ba9-a24d-14c4c9029371","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
