.5, -791.2], [2108.5, 728.0, -790.0])\r\n(99, [2108.5, 164.5, -791.2], [4027.3, 668.0, -790.0])","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"8e006838-177c-40ba-a8b2-cabf13500ff6","timestamp":"2026-10-04T12:33:06.578Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2eb3f57f-beb9-41f7-ba4d-50b56d383106","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
